  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the beef stock cubes, aji amarillo pepper, cumin, coriander, turmeric, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the pasta water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 2 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve the seco de cordero hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro."
